<title>SOUTH AFRICA: YABENG ISSUES PROFIT WARNING.</title>
<headline>YABENG ISSUES PROFIT WARNING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yabeng Investment Holding Company Ltd on Thursday advised shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until Choice Holdings Ltd results were published around May 30.</p>
<p>Choice said earlier in the week that attributable loss for the year ended February 1997 would be greater than anticipated. Yabeng owns an effective 19.56 percent of Choice.</p>
<p>Yabeng also has a 50 percent stake in CIC Investments (Pty) Ltd, which is managed by Choice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
